5.
Extension of Construction Duration
Additional construction administration time (3 months beyond original contract date for site
visits and OAC meetings —I. Senger: 208 hours © $175)hr) caused by delays in foundation
solution and implementation. The total sum to extend the construction duration is $36,400.
6.
Replat of Property
The total sum to prepare and record the replat of the property for your new facility is
$2,860.00. See attached email.
7.
Additional IT Design Services
Revise technology plans to incorporate changing the third floor cabling from CAT6E to
CAT6A. The total sum to revise the construction documents is $1,510.00. See attached
letter.
